# Distroless runtime baseline.
# Keep this file minimal and review exceptions frequently.
#
# Every entry MUST carry "# Review by: YYYY-MM-DD" — scripts/security-pipeline.sh
# fails the build once that date passes.
#
# CVE-2026-0861 (glibc memalign) was removed 2026-08-31: fixed in Debian 12
# as glibc 2.36-9+deb12u14; refreshed distroless base no longer matches.
#
# CVE-2026-84782 (openssl DTLS handshake retransmission / HIGH):
# - Debian 12 bookworm: NO fixed package as of 2026-09-30 (tracker still
#   marks 3.0.20-1~deb12u2 and security 3.0.22-1~deb12u1 as vulnerable;
#   upstream 3.0.23 is premium-support only).
# - Debian 13 trixie-security: fixed in openssl/libssl3t64 3.5.7-1~deb13u3
#   (DSA-6531-1).
# - Remediation in Dockerfile: runtime switched to
#   gcr.io/distroless/base-nossl-debian13:nonroot + libgcc_s (rustls-only
#   stack; OpenSSL not required). Do NOT add a silent ignore for this CVE.
